NEW: Big Bear bald eagle Shadow has been spotted with subadult eagle KD1, in the nest he shared with Jackie, just a few days after his partner of eight years died following weeks in intensive care at the Ojai Raptor Center.

On Thursday, the Friends of Big Bear Valley webcam captured the two eagles spending time in the nest together for the first time. Biologists say KD1, a banded eagle tracked since her birth, is almost of breeding age. 

